# 12. The complete mental model

This is important:

```text
USER OPENS SCREEN
       ↓
FutureBuilder
       ↓
API FUNCTION
       ↓
http.get()
       ↓
await
       ↓
SERVER RESPONSE
       ↓
JSON
       ↓
jsonDecode()
       ↓
DART DATA
       ↓
FutureBuilder
       ↓
UI
```

During the request:

```text
Loading indicator
```

If successful:

```text
Show data
```

If something fails:

```text
Show error
```

